    "objection": "The assumption that a free MCP tool would be more useful to developers is based on the belief that developers would prefer a free solution over a paid one. However, this assumption does not account for the potential value of a paid MCP tool that includes advanced features, customer support, and ongoing updates. A concrete requirement to evaluate this would be to conduct a survey among developers to understand their willingness to pay for a MCP tool with premium features.",
    "test": "Conduct a survey among a representative sample of developers to determine their willingness to pay for a MCP tool with features such as advanced model training capabilities, real-time model updates, and dedicated customer support. Analyze the survey results to determine if developers would be more likely to pay for a premium MCP tool compared to a free one."
  }
